+++ b/openspec/changes/archive/2026-11-20-fix-sku-shipping-vat-bugs/design.md
@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+## Context
+
+Three one-line defects: `Catalog.find` only trims its SKU (`src/catalog.ts`), `shippingCost` uses `>` against the threshold (`src/shipping.ts`), and `lineVat` uses `Math.floor` (`src/tax.ts`).
+
+## Decisions
+
+- `Catalog.find` uses the existing `canonicalSku`, so `get`, `getForSale`, `reprice` and `deactivate` are fixed too.
+- `shippingCost` uses `>=` with `FREE_SHIPPING_FROM_CENTS`.
+- `lineVat` uses `percentOf` from `src/money.ts`, as `shippingVat` already does; money stays in integer cents.
+- No new dependencies and no README change: it already states these rules.
+
+## Risks
+
+Orders already placed keep their stored amounts; nothing is recomputed.
diff --git a/openspec/changes/archive/2026-11-20-fix-sku-shipping-vat-bugs/proposal.md b/openspec/changes/archive/2026-11-20-fix-sku-shipping-vat-bugs/proposal.md
