@@ -0,0 +1,16 @@
+## ADDED Requirements
+
+### Requirement: SKUs are case-insensitive and trimmed
+The service SHALL treat SKUs as case-insensitive and ignoring surrounding spaces when looking a product up, and SHALL show the SKU in upper case.
+
+#### Scenario: Lower-case SKU on an order
+- **WHEN** an order is placed on 2026-03-02 with SKU `lb-220` and the catalogue holds `LB-220`
+- **THEN** the order is accepted and its line shows SKU `LB-220`
+
+#### Scenario: Padded mixed-case SKU
+- **WHEN** a product is looked up with ` Lb-220 `
+- **THEN** the product `LB-220` is returned
+
+#### Scenario: Unknown SKU
+- **WHEN** an order uses SKU `zz-999` that is not in the catalogue
+- **THEN** it is refused as an unknown product
diff --git a/openspec/changes/archive/2026-11-20-fix-sku-shipping-vat-bugs/specs/vat/spec.md b/openspec/changes/archive/2026-11-20-fix-sku-shipping-vat-bugs/specs/vat/spec.md
