@@ -0,0 +1,16 @@
+## ADDED Requirements
+
+### Requirement: Line VAT rounds half up
+VAT SHALL be computed per line on the line's net amount after every discount and rounded half up to the cent.
+
+#### Scenario: Single item
+- **WHEN** a single item at 199 cents has the standard rate (22%)
+- **THEN** its line VAT is 44 cents (43.78 rounded up)
+
+#### Scenario: Exactly half a cent
+- **WHEN** a line nets 25 cents at the standard rate (5.5 cents)
+- **THEN** its line VAT is 6 cents
+
+#### Scenario: Just below half a cent
+- **WHEN** a line nets 2 cents at the standard rate (0.44 cents)
+- **THEN** its line VAT is 0 cents
